---
import Email from '../components/Email.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site, legal } from '../data/site';
// NOTE: a plain-language starting point, not legal advice. Have it checked before relying on it.
// Before the shop opens, fill in the legal name and address in the admin panel (Settings): EU law requires
// the seller's identity and address to be shown to buyers.
const updated = '14 October 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms" description={`Terms of use, services and sales of ${site.name}.`}>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms" lead={`Last updated: ${updated}`} />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2 class="h3">Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website and the services and products on it are offered by {site.name}, an independent music
        label{legal.name ? <>, run by {legal.name}</> : ''}.
        {legal.address && <><br />Address: {legal.address}</>}
      </p>
      <p>Contact: <Email /></p>

      <h2 class="h3">Using this website</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>All music, videos, artwork, photos, logos and texts on this site belong to {site.name} or its artists. You may listen, watch and share links, but you may not copy, download, re-upload or use them commercially without written permission.</li>
        <li>Please only send real information through our forms and don't use them for spam or anything illegal.</li>
        <li>Links to other services (Spotify, YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, BeatStars and others) are provided for convenience. Their own terms apply there and we are not responsible for their content.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h3">Studio services (mixing, mastering, custom beats)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Prices are shown on the <a href="/services/">Services</a> page. The final price is confirmed by email before we start.</li>
        <li>50% is paid upfront. The rest is paid before you receive the final files.</li>
        <li>Two rounds of changes are included. Extra rounds are charged as shown on the Services page.</li>
        <li>You confirm that you own or have the rights to everything you send us (vocals, beats, samples, stems). You remain the owner of your song; we may mention the work as a credit (for example "Mixed by VIN") unless you ask us not to.</li>
        <li>If you cancel before we start working, the upfront payment is refunded. Once you have asked us to start, you agree that you lose your 14-day right of withdrawal for the work already done, as allowed by EU consumer law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h3">Beats on BeatStars</h2>
      <p>Beat leases and exclusives are sold on BeatStars. The licence you choose there and BeatStars' terms apply to those purchases.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">Shop orders</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Prices are in euros and include VAT where it applies. Shipping costs are shown before you pay.</li>
        <li>Payments are handled by Stripe (card, PayPal and others) or NOWPayments (crypto). We never see your card or wallet details.</li>
        <li>Your order is confirmed by email. Pre-orders ship on or around the release date.</li>
        <li><strong>Right of withdrawal:</strong> if you live in the EU, you can cancel your order within 14 days of delivery without giving a reason. Email us, then send the item back unused within 14 days. We refund the price and the standard shipping cost within 14 days of receiving it; return shipping is paid by you. CDs and records can only be returned if the seal is unbroken.</li>
        <li><strong>Guarantee:</strong> if an item arrives damaged or faulty, email us with a photo and we will replace or refund it. Your legal guarantee rights always apply.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h3">Liability</h2>
      <p>We do our best to keep this site correct and online, but we can't guarantee it is always available or error-free. As far as the law allows, we are not liable for indirect damage. Nothing in these terms limits your rights as a consumer.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">Changes and applicable law</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms; the date at the top shows the latest version. The terms that applied when you ordered stay valid for that order. The law of the country where the label is registered applies. If you are a consumer, you also keep the protection of the law of the country where you live.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">Questions or problems</h2>
      <p>Email <Email /> and we'll find a solution together. Also see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .h3 { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); margin-top: 2.2rem; }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.1rem; color: #d9d5ce; }
  .prose li { padding: 0.3rem 0; }
</style>
